  "title": "Stoneridge, Inc. to Broadcast Its Fourth Quarter 2025 Conference Call on the Web",
  "summary": "NOVI, Mich., March 2, 2026 /PRNewswire/ -- Stoneridge, Inc. (NYSE: SRI) will webcast its fourth quarter 2025 earnings conference call live on Thursday, March 12, 2026, at 9:00 a.m. ET with members of the executive team. The webcast can be accessed on the Presentations & Events page of the Investors section of the Company's website,",
